1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:06,500
TÈ-LA KA PALÉ…
(La terre parle…)

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,500
ANBA PYÉ NOU…
(Sous nos pieds…)

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,800
SÉ PA JIS LATÈ…
(ce n'est pas juste de la terre…)

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,300
SÉ MEMWA…
(C'est mémoire…)

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,500
SÉ SAN…
(c'est sang…)

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,800
